---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Artwork from '../components/Artwork.astro';
import { projects, filters } from '../data/projects';
import { site } from '../data/site';
const services = [
  { number: '01', icon: '◫', title: 'Graphic design.', text: 'A distinct visual voice. From the first impression to the smallest detail.', tags: ['Posters & campaigns', 'Thumbnails', 'Social graphics', 'Visual identity'] },
  { number: '02', icon: '▷', title: 'Moving images.', text: 'Stories with rhythm. Thoughtful edits that turn footage into a feeling.', tags: ['Video editing', 'Color & finishing', 'Motion graphics', 'Content production'] },
  { number: '03', icon: '⌁', title: 'Content systems.', text: 'A consistent creative presence. From the first idea to the final upload.', tags: ['Social media management', 'Copywriting', 'Content planning', 'Team workflows'] },
];
---
<Layout home>
  <section id="intro" class="hero tracked-section" data-section-label="Dimension">
    <div class="section-bar"><span>01 / Dimension studio</span><span>Design · Film · Flight</span></div>
    <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true"><img src={site.fpvPoster} alt="" fetchpriority="high" width="1536" height="1024" />{site.fpvVideo && <video class="hero-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster={site.fpvPoster}><source src={site.fpvVideo} type="video/mp4" /></video>}</div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-cross">+</span> A creative company. An uncommon perspective.</p><h1>Visuals with<br />another<br /><em>dimension.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">We shape ideas into visuals that move you.<br class="desktop-break" /> Design, moving images & the art of flight.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="#work">Explore the work <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#fpv"><span class="play-small">▷</span> Into the sky</a></div></div>
      <div class="hero-gallery" data-tilt><div class="hero-gallery-label"><span>Selected perspectives</span><span>↙ 01—04</span></div><div class="hero-art-grid">{[projects[0], projects[1], projects[2], projects[5]].map(p => <a href={`/work/${p.slug}/`} aria-label={`Explore ${p.title}`}><Artwork project={p}/><span class="hero-art-tag">{p.discipline.split(' / ')[0]} ↗</span></a>)}</div><div class="hero-gallery-bottom"><span>Different mediums. Same intent.</span><span class="signal"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-bottom"><span>Independent in thought. Intentional in craft.</span><a href="#work">Scroll to discover <span>↓</span></a><span class="hero-coordinates">Ideas into impact <span>↗</span></span></div>
  </section>

  <section id="work" class="work-section tracked-section" data-section-label="Selected work">
    <div class="section-bar"><span>02 / Selected work</span><span>Experiments. Expressions. Perspectives.</span></div>
    <div class="section-intro reveal"><p class="eyebrow">The work speaks first.</p><div class="intro-row"><h2>Different forms.<br />One <em>point of view.</em></h2><p>A collection across design, imagery and digital culture. Built to make you look. Made to make you feel.</p></div></div>
    <div class="gallery-toolbar"><div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter projects">{filters.map((f, i) => <button data-filter={f} aria-pressed={i === 0} class:list={['filter', {'is-active': i === 0}]}>{f}{i === 0 && <span>09</span>}</button>)}</div><span class="project-count" aria-live="polite">09 projects</span></div>
    <div class="project-grid">{projects.map(p => <article class="project-card reveal" data-category={p.category}><a href={`/work/${p.slug}/`} class="project-image-link" aria-label={`View ${p.title}`}><Artwork project={p}/><span class="project-open">View project ↗</span>{!p.image && <span class="concept-tag">Concept preview</span>}</a><div class="project-caption"><div><p class="eyebrow">{p.number} / {p.category}</p><h3><a href={`/work/${p.slug}/`}>{p.title}</a></h3></div><a class="project-arrow" href={`/work/${p.slug}/`} aria-label={`Explore ${p.title}`}>↗</a></div></article>)}</div>
    <div class="gallery-note"><span><span class="status-dot"></span> A collection in progress.</span><p>AI concept previews shown while our original work is being curated.</p><a class="text-link" href={site.notion} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore the original archive ↗</a></div>
  </section>

  <section id="fpv" class="fpv-section tracked-section" data-section-label="In flight">
    <div class="section-bar"><span>03 / FPV cinematics</span><span>A new point of view</span></div>
    <div class="fpv-stage"><div class="fpv-image" data-parallax><img src={site.fpvPoster} alt="AI concept of an FPV perspective over a dramatic coastal road at sunset" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="fpv-scrim"></div><div class="fpv-hud"><span><i class="status-dot"></i> Dimension / In flight</span><span>FPV CINEMATICS</span></div><div class="fpv-heading reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Less distance. More feeling.</p><h2>Some stories<br />need <em>wings.</em></h2><p>Beyond the frame. Through the landscape.<br />A perspective that brings you closer.</p>{site.fpvVideo ? <button class="button button-primary" data-open-film>Watch the film <span>▷</span></button> : <span class="film-coming"><span class="status-dot"></span> First flight film — in the making</span>}</div><div class="fpv-reticle" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><i></i></div><div class="fpv-bottom"><span>Creative flight / Cinematic vision</span><span>{site.fpvVideo ? 'DIMENSION ORIGINAL' : 'VISUAL CONCEPT · FILM COMING SOON'}</span><span>↗ No ordinary angle.</span></div></div>
    <div class="fpv-description"><p>Perspective changes everything.</p><span>FPV is a way of seeing. We’re bringing the same attention to composition, atmosphere and detail from our design work into the air.</span><a href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=FPV%20cinematics%20enquiry`} class="text-link">Talk about a flight ↗</a></div>
  </section>

  <section id="services" class="services-section tracked-section" data-section-label="The craft">
    <div class="section-bar"><span>04 / What we do</span><span>Thought through. Crafted with intent.</span></div>
    <div class="section-intro reveal"><p class="eyebrow">From an idea to an impression.</p><div class="intro-row"><h2>Considered craft.<br /><em>Across dimensions.</em></h2><p>One creative partner. A range of ways to bring your story into focus.</p></div></div>
    <div class="services-grid">{services.map(s => <article class="service-card reveal"><div class="service-top"><span>{s.number}</span><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">{s.icon}</span><span>↗</span></div><h3>{s.title}</h3><p>{s.text}</p><ul>{s.tags.map(t => <li>{t}</li>)}</ul></article>)}</div>
    <div class="services-bottom"><p>Every project is different. So is the approach.</p><a href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=Project%20quote%20enquiry`} class="text-link">Let’s find your direction. Contact for a quote ↗</a></div>
  </section>

  <section id="about" class="about-section tracked-section" data-section-label="Our approach">
    <div class="section-bar"><span>05 / Behind Dimension</span><span>The thinking behind the making</span></div>
    <div class="about-main"><div class="about-emblem" data-tilt><span class="orbit orbit-one"></span><span class="orbit orbit-two"></span><span class="orbit-cross one">+</span><span class="orbit-cross two">+</span><img src="/brand/dimension-symbol.png" alt="Dimension emblem" width="1280" height="1280" loading="lazy" /><span class="about-emblem-label">A different way to see.</span></div><div class="about-copy reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Independent spirit. Collective vision.</p><h2>Good work starts<br />with <em>curiosity.</em></h2><p>Dimension is a creative company exploring the space between design, moving images and digital culture. We bring a considered eye to every frame, every composition and every story.</p><p>Our work spans original photography, graphic design, video editing and content production. The medium changes. The intention stays the same: make something worth paying attention to.</p><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="text-link">Meet your next creative partner ↗</a></div></div>
    <div class="process-grid"><article class="reveal"><span class="eyebrow">01 / Understand</span><h3>Start with why.</h3><p>The audience, the intention, the thing you want people to feel. We find the right questions first.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span class="eyebrow">02 / Explore</span><h3>Find the unexpected.</h3><p>References, compositions and directions. We give the idea space to become something distinct.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span class="eyebrow">03 / Make</span><h3>Care for the details.</h3><p>Build, refine and finish. A considered result, ready for the place it’s meant to live.</p></article></div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="contact-section tracked-section" data-section-label="Let’s talk"><div class="section-bar"><span>06 / Your next dimension</span><span>It starts with a conversation.</span></div><div class="contact-content reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Have something in mind?</p><h2>Let’s make<br /><em>an impression.</em><span class="contact-asterisk" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></h2><div class="contact-row"><a class="contact-email" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}<span>↗</span></a><p>Tell us what you’re imagining.<br />We’ll take it from there.</p></div><div class="contact-socials"><a href={site.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram ↗</a><a href={site.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a><a href={site.notion} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original work archive ↗</a><span>Contact for a quote.</span></div></div></section>
  {site.fpvVideo && <dialog class="film-dialog"><form method="dialog"><button class="dialog-close" aria-label="Close film">Close ✕</button></form><video controls playsinline preload="none" poster={site.fpvPoster}><source src={site.fpvVideo} type="video/mp4" /></video></dialog>}
</Layout>
